---
description: Decide field-level findings for modelExperience.
args: { goal: string; slice: EvidenceSlice }
returns: DecisionAtom[]
---
Apply this domain algorithm to the prepared slice: Interpret the creative brief, venue, prop capabilities, audience needs, and approved safety rules. Separate dramatic fiction from actual participant constraints, preserve unrestricted emergency exit and staff intervention, and identify unsupported physical mechanisms before puzzle design. For each consequential field return a value and evidence IDs, mark established, disputed, unknown, or inapplicable, and name a plausible alternative. Do not turn missing evidence into a negative fact or treat repeated volume as independent support unless the domain rule says so.
